      "label": { "zh-CN": "光学配色预设", "en": "Optical color preset" },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "选择深色或浅色光学预设作为基底，下方任意组件均可在预设之上独立覆盖",
        "en": "Pick a light or dark optical preset as base; any component setting below overrides the preset"
      }
